        "move_lightning_deity",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Illusion Garden, searching Gu Immortals realize Song Zi Xing’s real body never left the red-egg battlefield still floating in the air, which they had left alone to avoid spending immortal essence and helping Vicious Lightning Fiend. Under their intense attacks the field trembles; three breaths later he removes it, it collapses, and he flies out in a bloody rainbow holding Blazing Demonic Immortal Dan Qiao’s corpse while Vicious Lightning Fiend lies comatose with one weak lightning deity left. The move isolates its interior from the world as an independent area, and with Song Zi Xing’s extra methods it blocks those trapped inside from calling for outside help.",
      "chapters": [
        849
      ],
